  "prompt": "An alpha-particle consists of two protons and two neutrons, with a total mass of 6.64 * 10^-27 kg. In an experiment, the alpha-particle is emitted with a speed of 1.50 * 10^7 m s^-1. What is the kinetic energy of the alpha-particle?",
