    "explanation": "E_k = (1/2)mv^2 = 0.5 * (6.64 * 10^-27 kg) * (1.50 * 10^7 m s^-1)^2 = 0.5 * 6.64 * 10^-27 * 2.25 * 10^14 = 7.47 * 10^-13 J."
